          {
            "id": 2772823,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "First of all, let me thank you all for coming to this public meeting to discuss the future of our town. Our first speaker is Shona Ferguson from Barford Town Council. Shona.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2772824,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "First of all, let me thank you all for coming to this public meeting to discuss the future of our town.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 63.59,
                  "from": 58.55,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772846,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Our first speaker is Shona Ferguson from Barford Town Council.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 67.75,
                  "from": 63.91,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772857,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Shona.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 68.825005,
                  "from": 68.025,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2772859,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Thank you. First, I'll briefly give you some background information, then I'll be asking you for your comments on developments in the town. Well, as you don't need me to tell you, Barford has changed a great deal in the last fifty years. These are some of the main changes. Fifty years ago, buses linked virtually every part of the town and the neighboring towns and villages.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2772860,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Thank you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 70.185,
                  "from": 69.385,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772863,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "First, I'll briefly give you some background information, then I'll be asking you for your comments on developments in the town.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 77.225,
                  "from": 70.585,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772885,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, as you don't need me to tell you, Barford has changed a great deal in the last fifty years.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 83.545,
                  "from": 77.945,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772906,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "These are some of the main changes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 86.4,
                  "from": 84.240005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772914,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Fifty years ago, buses linked virtually every part of the town and the neighboring towns and villages.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 93.200005,
                  "from": 87.200005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2772929,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Most people used them frequently, but not now because the bus companies concentrate on just the routes that attract most passengers. So parts of the town are no longer served by buses. Even replacing old uncomfortable buses with smart new ones has had little impact on passenger numbers. It's sometimes said that bus fares are too high, but in relation to average incomes, fares are not much higher than they were fifty years ago. Changes in the road network are affecting the town.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2772930,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Most people used them frequently, but not now because the bus companies concentrate on just the routes that attract most passengers.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 101.795006,
                  "from": 93.520004,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772952,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So parts of the town are no longer served by buses.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 105.555,
                  "from": 102.355,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772964,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Even replacing old uncomfortable buses with smart new ones has had little impact on passenger numbers.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 113.23,
                  "from": 106.275,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2772981,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's sometimes said that bus fares are too high, but in relation to average incomes, fares are not much higher than they were fifty years ago.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 122.19,
                  "from": 113.87,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2773008,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Changes in the road network are affecting the town.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 127.064995,
                  "from": 123.704994,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2773018,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The center was recently closed to traffic on a trial basis, making it much safer for pedestrians. The impact of this is being measured. The new cycle paths separating bikes from cars in most main roads are being used far more than was expected, reducing traffic and improving air quality. And although the council's attempts to have a bypass constructed have failed, we haven't given up hope of persuading the government to change its mind. Shopping in the town centre has changed over the years.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2773019,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The center was recently closed to traffic on a trial basis, making it much safer for pedestrians.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 133.705,
                  "from": 127.305,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2773037,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The impact of this is being measured.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 136.025,
                  "from": 134.185,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2773045,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The new cycle paths separating bikes from cars in most main roads are being used far more than was expected, reducing traffic and improving air quality.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 147.86,
                  "from": 137.06,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2773072,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And although the council's attempts to have a bypass constructed have failed, we haven't given up hope of persuading the government to change its mind.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 157.13501,
                  "from": 148.34,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2773098,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Shopping in the town centre has changed over the years.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 161.29501,
                  "from": 158.175,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2773109,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Many of us can remember when the town was crowded with people going shopping. Numbers have been falling for several years despite efforts to attract shoppers, for instance, by opening new car parks. Some people combine shopping with visits to the town's restaurants and cafes. Most shops are small independent stores, which is good, but many people prefer to use supermarkets and department stores in nearby large towns, as there are so few well known chain stores here. Turning now to medical facilities.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2773110,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Many of us can remember when the town was crowded with people going shopping.",
