                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2773198,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The town is served by family doctors in several medical practices, fewer than fifty years ago but each catering for far more patients. Our hospital closed fifteen years ago, which means journeys to other towns are unavoidable. On the other hand, there are more dentists than there used to be. Employment patterns have changed along with almost everything else. The number of schools and colleges has increased, making that the main employment sector.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2773199,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The town is served by family doctors in several medical practices, fewer than fifty years ago but each catering for far more patients.",
